a birthday message.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"축하하는","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"eq10866_3","ko":"친구가 취직해서 다 같이 축하했어요.","en":"My friend got a job, so we all celebrated.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"축하했어요","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"eq10866_4","ko":"결혼을 축하해 주러 많은 사람이 왔어요.","en":"Many people came to congratulate them on their wedding.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"축하해","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"eq10866_5","ko":"졸업을 축하하려고 꽃다발을 샀어요.","en":"I bought a bouquet to congratulate them on graduating.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"축하하려고","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"eq10866_6","ko":"선생님, 승진 축하드려요!","en":"Teacher, congratulations on your promotion!","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"축하드려요","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""}],"pron":"추카하다","roman":"chukahada","explain":"'생일 축하해요', '합격 축하해요'처럼 축하할 일 뒤에 바로 써요. 웃어른께는 '축하드려요'라고 말해요. '축하해 주다'는 상대를 위해 해 주는 느낌이에요.","video_url":"","video_title":"","phrases":[],"pron_source":"앱 확장 [기본안]","pron_why":null,"dict_examples":[],"explain_en":"It follows the occasion directly, as in '생일 축하해요' and '합격 축하해요'. To someone senior, say '축하드려요'. '축하해 주다' adds a feeling of doing it for the other person.","contract_en":"","dis":""},{"id":"n01031","kind":"word","ko":"장","yo":"","en":"flat items; tickets/sheets","pos":"의존 명사","usage":"","contract":"","examples":[{"id":"e01943","ko":"표 두 장 주세요.","en":"Two tickets, please.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"장","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e01944","ko":"티셔츠 세 장에 만 원이에요.","en":"Three T-shirts for 10,000 won.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"장","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e10280","ko":"저는 사진을 네 장 찍어요.","en":"I take four photos.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"장","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e10281","ko":"영수증 한 장 주세요.","en":"One receipt, please.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"장","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e10282","ko":"엽서 두 장에 천 원이에요.","en":"Two postcards are 1,000 won.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"장","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""}],"pron":"장","roman":"jang","explain":"종이처럼 얇고 평평한 것은 ‘장’으로 세어요. 종이, 표, 사진, 엽서가 그래요.","video_url":"","video_title":"","phrases":[],"pron_source":"우리말샘","pron_why":null,"dict_examples":[{"ko":"종이 한 장.","en":"One sheet of paper.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"아주머니 여기 부침개 석 장만 포장해 주세요.","en":"Ma'am, please pack just three pieces of buchimgae for me.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"벽에는 노랗고 퇴색한 사진이 두 장 걸려 있다.","en":"Two yellowed, faded photos hang on the wall.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"}],"explain_en":"Thin, flat things like paper are counted with 장: paper, tickets, photos, postcards.","contract_en":"","dis":""},{"id":"n00518","kind":"word","ko":"선물","yo":"","en":"Gift / Present","pos":"명사","usage":"","contract":"","examples":[{"id":"e01397","ko":"친구 생일 선물로 꽃을 샀어요.","en":"I bought flowers as a birthday present for my friend.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"선물","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e01398","ko":"어머니 생신 선물로 뭐가 좋아요?","en":"What would be a good birthday present for my mother?","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"선물","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e16129","ko":"선물 포장해 주세요.","en":"Please gift-wrap it.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"선물","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e16130","ko":"생일 선물을 받고 기분이 좋았어요.","en":"I got a birthday present and felt happy.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"선물","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e16131","ko":"이 선물은 누구한테 줄 거예요?","en":"Who are you going to give this present to?","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"선물","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""}],"pron":"선ː물","roman":"seonmul","explain":"어른에게는 “선물을 드려요”, 친구에게는 “선물을 줘요”라고 해요.","video_url":"","video_title":"","phrases":[],"pron_source":"우리말샘","pron_why":null,"dict_examples":[{"ko":"생일 선물.","en":"a birthday present","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"축하 선물.","en":"a congratulatory gift","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"선물을 보내다.","en":"to send a gift","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"선물을 주다.","en":"to give a gift","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"선물을 마련하다.","en":"to prepare a gift","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"}],"explain_en":"To an elder you say 선물을 드려요; to a friend, 선물을 줘요.","contract_en":"","dis":""},{"id":"n00842","kind":"word","ko":"그거","yo":"","en":"that (thing near you) — spoken","pos":"대명사","usage":"그거 = spoken short form of 그것.","contract":"","examples":[{"id":"e01606","ko":"그거 뭐예요?","en":"What's that?","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"그거","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e01607","ko":"그거 제 가방이에요.","en":"That one by you is my bag.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"그거","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e08563","ko":"그거 한국어 책이에요?","en":"Is that a Korean book?","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"그거","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e08564","ko":"그거 커피예요? — 네, 커피예요.","en":"Is that coffee? — Yes, it's coffee.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"그거","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e08565","ko":"그거 제 친구 우산이에요.","en":"That is my friend's umbrella.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"그거","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""}],"pron":"그거","roman":"geugeo","explain":"그거는 듣는 사람 가까이에 있는 물건뿐 아니라, 방금 들은 이야기도 가리켜요. 그래서 대화에서 아주 자주 나와요.","video_url":"","video_title":"","phrases":[{"ko":"그건 그래요","example":"그 식당 좀 비싸죠? — 그건 그래요.","en":"That's true; I'll give you that.","nuance_ko":"상대 말을 일부 인정할 때","source":"AI","nuance_en":"said when you partly agree with what the other person said","en_equiv":"That's true; I'll give you that."}],"pron_source":"우리말샘","pron_why":null,"dict_examples":[{"ko":"그거 좋은 생각인데.","en":"That's a good idea.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"그거 좀 가져와 봐.","en":"Bring that over.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"그건 나도 모른다.","en":"I don't know that either.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"},{"ko":"문제는 바로 그거다.","en":"That is exactly the problem.","src":"국립국어원 우리말샘 (CC BY-SA 2.0 KR) · 영어: AI 번역"}],"explain_en":"그거 points to something near the listener, but also to something that was just mentioned in the conversation. That is why it shows up so often in speech.","contract_en":"","dis":""}]